  "Id": 1667,
  "Title": "Victoria Hall Wins RIBA National Award ",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Victoria Hall King's Cross has won RIBA National Award for architecture in 2018.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClassE676A14148F04B51830B67E123E17EE0\"><p><a href=\"http&#58;//www.victoriahallkingscross.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Victoria Hall King's Cross</a> has won RIBA National Award for architecture in 2018. The building was among 49 projects in the UK being awarded for their architectural excellence.</p><div><a href=\"https&#58;//www.architecture.com/awards-and-competitions-landing-page/awards/riba-regional-awards/riba-london-award-winners/2018/victoria-hall-kings-cross\" target=\"_blank\">RIBA</a>'s reflection on the building&#58; \"The architect has raised the bar for the design quality of student residences where the immaculate detailing and high quality, natural finishes convey a sense of permanence as well as reference both the adobe architecture of the Middle East and the industrial heritage of King's Cross.\"&#160;</div><div><br></div><div>Victoria Hall&#160;is student accommodation in the heart of King's Cross, London. It's an 11-storey building designed by award-winning London-based <a href=\"https&#58;//www.stantonwilliams.com/\">Stanton Williams </a>architects. The building houses students from AKU-ISMC&#160;and others and has stylish communal spaces, which include a gym, reading room, meeting and A/V room and a lounge area.</div><div><br></div><div>Victoria Hall also has two outdoor spaces - a courtyard on the first floor and a terraced garden on the eighth floor, both designed by Vladimir Djurovic who also designed the Aga Khan Park in Toronto.&#160;</div></div>",
